# Local notes: the project README is the only Markdown tracked here.
*.[mM][dD]
!/README.md
!/CHANGELOG.md

# Artwork and Photoshop sources
*.[pP][nN][gG]
*.[pP][nN][gG].meta
*.[pP][sS][dD]
*.[pP][sS][dD].meta

# Images embedded in Overhaul.dll are required to compile.
!/Overhaul/Assets/spirit_icon.png
!/Overhaul/Assets/spirit_texture.png
!/Overhaul/Assets/hoe_drain_tar.png

# Build products, IDE state and local archives
**/bin/
**/obj/
.vs/
.idea/
*.user
*.suo
*.dll
*.exe
*.pdb
*.mdb
*.zip
*.7z
*.rar
*.log
*.tmp
*.bak

# Developer tools: their README and the Assimp libraries needed to build them.
!/DevTools/*/README.md
!/DevTools/AnimationPreview/lib/*.dll
